{"title":"RESIN ART COLLECTION","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"cm-003-butt-only","title":"Maple x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eDesigned for players who value both performance and eye-catching craftsmanship, this custom cue combines premium materials with timeless point construction. The forearm and butt sleeve feature striking maple points accented with vibrant resin, while the matching resin handle provides a comfortable grip and a unique marbled appearance. Elegant abalone inlays add a refined finishing touch, making this cue stand out on and off the table.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLength:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\" Butt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin \u0026amp; Maple Points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin \u0026amp; Maple Points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Abalone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandcrafted by Cues Master\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for consistent playability and lasting durability, this cue delivers a solid hit with premium aesthetics—perfect for players seeking a distinctive custom cue.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43446670852144,"sku":null,"price":25000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/48