y of the wood while delivering a deep, mirror-like finish. Rich \u003cstrong\u003espalted tamarind\u003c\/strong\u003e accents and meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eabalone diamond inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e create a striking visual contrast, while the \u003cstrong\u003epremium Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e provides exceptional comfort and a secure grip during play.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors, the Imperial Heritage combines traditional craftsmanship with refined design. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a premium collection, it stands as a testament to precision, elegance, and enduring quality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-Gloss Resin Coating\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccent Wood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Spalted Tamarind\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Diamond Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTimeless craftsmanship. Refined elegance. Built to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"z-0 flex min-h-