ve flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eBold, sophisticated, and meticulously handcrafted, the \u003cstrong\u003eMidnight Ember\u003c\/strong\u003e is a striking fusion of natural beauty and modern craftsmanship. Built from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt features dramatic long points accented with \u003cstrong\u003estabilized burl wood\u003c\/strong\u003e and deep \u003cstrong\u003eblack resin\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a design rich in depth, contrast, and character. A beautifully figured \u003cstrong\u003erosewood butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e adds warmth and elegance, while the \u003cstrong\u003epremium Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e provides a comfortable, secure grip for confident play.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Midnight Ember showcases the precision, artistry, and attention to detail that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft for competition or displayed as part of a premium collection, it is a cue that commands attention both on and off the table.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccent Materials:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stabilized Burl Wood \u0026amp; Black Resin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rosewood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDistinctive materials. Timeless craftsmanship. Designed to perform, built to be admired.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-center\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453372563504,"sku":null,"price":24000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/5b413cef-d0d1-438b-af9d-371b58e39fc3.png?v=1785651982"},{"product_id":"butterfly-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Butterfly Maple x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003e Handcrafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt features a flawlessly executed \u003cstrong\u003ebutterfly splice design\u003c\/strong\u003e enhanced by a lustrous \u003cstrong\u003epearl resin coating\u003c\/strong\u003e, vibrant multi-colored veneers, and meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e. The flowing symmetry of the butterfly points creates striking visual depth, while the seamless \u003cstrong\u003eresin wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers a sleek, polished feel.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Butterfly Legacy reflects the craftsmanship, innovation, and attention to detail that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a premium collection, it is a cue that celebrates tradition while embracing modern design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Butterfly Splice Design, Pearl Resin Coating\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Resin Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA timeless butterfly design, elevated through modern craftsmanship and built to stand apart.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453501079600,"sku":null,"price":24000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/d683821e-3292-4275-992b-cf0248fc9c96.png?v=1785656187"},{"product_id":"emerald-fusion-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Butterfly x Maple x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eBold, vibrant, and meticulously handcrafted, the \u003cstrong\u003eEmerald Fusion\u003c\/strong\u003e reimagines the timeless butterfly cue with a contemporary blend of color, craftsmanship, and precision. Crafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt features expertly executed \u003cstrong\u003ebutterfly splice construction\u003c\/strong\u003e accented by vibrant \u003cstrong\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e that create striking depth and visual movement. The luxurious \u003cstrong\u003eemerald resin wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e serves as the centerpiece, offering a seamless, high-gloss finish, exceptional durability, and a comfortable, confident grip.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Emerald Fusion seamlessly blends traditional cue-making techniques with modern materials. Every detail—from the precision butterfly splice work to the flawless resin finish—reflects the artistry, innovation, and uncompromising quality that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a premium collection, this cue is designed to make a lasting impression.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Butterfly Splice Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Emerald Resin Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClassic butterfly craftsmanship. Contemporary elegance. Handcrafted to perform and built to be admired.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453518512176,"sku":null,"price":24000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/3d8d7a17-04df-4ce4-a7e9-b06624fd4c70.png?v=1785656920"},{"product_id":"crimson-elegance-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Crimson Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/strong\u003e is adorned with meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eresin and plastic ivory inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a sophisticated focal point that highlights the cue's clean lines and elegant proportions. A rich \u003cstrong\u003ecrimson resin wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e provides a seamless, high-gloss finish and a comfortable, confident grip, while the \u003cstrong\u003eebony butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, accented with matching resin and plastic ivory inlays, adds depth, contrast, and luxurious appeal.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Crimson Elegance embodies the precision, balance, and artistry that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft for play or displayed as part of a premium collection, this cue is crafted to deliver exceptional performance with timeless style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Plastic Ivory Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resin Grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony with Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Plastic Ivory Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClassic elegance. Modern craftsmanship. Handcrafted to perform and built to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453543809072,"sku":null,"price":17000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/cf61b1ce-1954-4737-97f6-e6499679839e.png?v=1785658039"},{"product_id":"amethyst-royale-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Ebony wood x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003e Crafted from\u003cstrong\u003e Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, the forearm showcases striking \u003cstrong\u003eebony points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented by vibrant \u003cstrong\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e and meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating exceptional depth, contrast, and visual elegance. A lustrous \u003cstrong\u003eamethyst resin coating\u003c\/strong\u003e enhances the natural beauty of the design with a rich, high-gloss finish, while the \u003cstrong\u003epremium Black Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e provides a secure, comfortable grip and a refined playing experience.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eebony butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, adorned with matching handcrafted abalone inlays, completes the cue with perfect harmony and sophistication. Designed for discerning players and collectors, the Amethyst Royale reflects the precision, artistry, and uncompromising craftsmanship that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft for play or displayed as a centerpiece in a premium collection, this cue is built to impress from every angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Ebony Points, Multi-Colored Veneers \u0026amp; Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCoating:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-Gloss Amethyst Resin Coating\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Black Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony with Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClassic craftsmanship. Contemporary elegance. Handcrafted to perform and built to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453551018032,"sku":null,"price":23000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/1076f993-23e7-450b-b8c4-79839d5b5836.png?v=1785659423"},{"product_id":"maple-crest-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Rosewood (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted from \u003cstrong\u003ehard maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, the forearm showcases elegant \u003cstrong\u003elong points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented with meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a clean, sophisticated design that highlights the wood's distinctive figure. A \u003cstrong\u003epremium Brown Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e offers a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip, while the richly figured \u003cstrong\u003erosewood butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e brings warmth, depth, and a refined finishing touch.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Maple Crest embodies the precision, balance, and exceptional craftsmanship that define every Cues Master creation. Every element is carefully crafted to enhance both performance and aesthetics, resulting in a cue that is as rewarding to play with as it is to admire. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a distinguished collection, the Maple Crest is a timeless expression of handcrafted excellence.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ehard maple\u003c\/strong\u003e with Long Points \u0026amp; Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Brown Luxe Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Rosewood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNatural beauty. Precision craftsmanship. Handcrafted to perform and built to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453554819120,"sku":null,"price":15000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/9bde1631-94cf-41e2-86b3-751e676f60eb.png?v=1785661651"},{"product_id":"untitled-aug6_03-12-08","title":"Northern Ember – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStriking, refined, and deeply rooted in natural beauty, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNorthern Ember\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together elegant Canadian maple, dramatic organic wood grain, and contemporary resin artistry. The \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a clean, warm foundation, enhanced by meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e that introduce depth, color, and character to the design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe cue transitions into a distinctive \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003espalted wood butt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, showcasing naturally occurring grain patterns that make every piece truly one of a kind. Rich \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin accents\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e flow throughout the design, creating a seamless connection between the natural wood elements, while the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds a modern aesthetic with a smooth and comfortable feel in the hand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompleting the design are \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding clean lines and visual balance throughout the cue. The combination of Canadian maple, dramatic spalted wood, handcrafted inlays, and vibrant resin creates a contemporary masterpiece where \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003etraditional artisan craftsmanship meets modern cue design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for players who appreciate individuality and exceptional craftsmanship, the Northern Ember is more than a playing cue—it is a statement piece. Every grain, inlay, resin detail, and handcrafted element contributes to a cue that is unmistakably unique.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandle \/ Grip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Resin Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Spalted Wood with Resin Accents\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Resin Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural beauty. Bold character. Modern craftsmanship. A one-of-a-kind cue built to be played, admired, and remembered.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43461354258480,"sku":null,"price":20000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/123.png?v=1786593600"},{"product_id":"arctic-abyss-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Arctic Abyss – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, elegant, and inspired by the mysterious depths of northern waters, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArctic Abyss\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the natural beauty of premium Canadian maple with the captivating movement of colored resin. Its design captures the contrast between organic wood grain and flowing resin artistry, creating a cue that feels both refined and distinctly modern.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a clean, sophisticated foundation, enhanced by meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e flowing through rich shades of blue and violet. Each resin element is carefully shaped and integrated into the maple, creating a dynamic pattern with remarkable depth, movement, and individuality.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe design continues through the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecustom resin grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, carrying the same artistic character into the handle for a seamless contemporary aesthetic. Decorative \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecustom ringwork\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides clean transitions and visual balance throughout the cue, while the precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e ensures a secure and accurate connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors, the Arctic Abyss reflects the craftsmanship, precision, and creativity behind every Cues Master creation. It is a distinctive expression of modern cue artistry—where natural materials and handcrafted resin come together to create something truly one of a kind.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandle \/ Grip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Resin Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRingwork:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Decorative Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural maple. Flowing resin. Modern artistry. The Arctic Abyss is handcrafted for those who appreciate a cue unlike any other.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484542566448,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/456.png?v=1786593942"},{"product_id":"emerald-frost-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Emerald Frost – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eElegant, distinctive, and meticulously handcrafted, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmerald Frost\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e brings together the natural warmth of premium Canadian maple, the bold character of emerald resin, and the iridescent beauty of abalone. Designed with a striking balance of color, texture, and precision, this custom pool cue is a modern expression of refined cue-making artistry.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e serves as a clean natural canvas for carefully handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Long, tapered inlays flow gracefully along the forearm, creating a sharp and symmetrical pattern that contrasts beautifully against the maple grain. Subtle abalone details introduce flashes of natural iridescence, adding depth and sophistication to the design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe cue transitions into a distinctive \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ewhite resin grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, featuring a flowing pattern that complements the deep green resin while creating a crisp, contemporary contrast. Matching green resin details continue through the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ebutt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, bringing visual harmony to the entire cue. Completing the design are meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding refined flashes of color throughout the ringwork.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for players who demand both artistry and performance, the Emerald Frost is equipped with a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Kielwood shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUS phenolic ferrule\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for a solid, responsive, and consistent hit. A precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e completes the connection between butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGrip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom White Resin Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Canadian Maple \u0026amp; Green Resin with Abalone Details\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eShaft:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Kielwood Shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Black Diamond Tip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e US Phenolic Ferrule\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural maple. Emerald resin. Iridescent abalone. Precision craftsmanship. Emerald Frost is where bold modern design meets the timeless art of handcrafted cue making.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484561211440,"sku":null,"price":28000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/121314.png?v=1786599559"},{"product_id":"emerald-sovereign-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Emerald Sovereign – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRefined, commanding, and crafted with an unmistakable sense of luxury, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmerald Sovereign\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that celebrates the natural character of premium ashwood and the timeless beauty of abalone. Its design brings together organic wood grain, rich resin accents, and intricate handcrafted details to create a cue with a distinctly regal presence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a light, elegant foundation for meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Sophisticated geometric patterns flow through the forearm and butt sleeve, combining rich resin accents with the natural iridescence of abalone to create a design that is intricate yet perfectly balanced.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLuxe wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds a rich, refined texture to the handle while creating a striking contrast against the lighter ashwood. Carefully crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e introduce subtle flashes of color throughout the cue, tying the inlay work together and adding another layer of sophistication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEvery element of the Emerald Sovereign is thoughtfully crafted to achieve a harmonious balance between natural wood, deep resin tones, and iridescent abalone artistry. Designed for discerning players and collectors alike, it is a cue that commands attention in the hands and stands proudly as a centerpiece in any collection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Luxe Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural ashwood. Rich resin. Iridescent abalone. Timeless luxury—crafted into a cue with a presence all its own.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484565569584,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/141516_68f88d20-5050-4f7f-b392-f3671e97be93.png?v=1786599818"},{"product_id":"sapphire-noir-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Sapphire Noir – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, sophisticated, and designed to command attention, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSapphire Noir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the natural character of premium ashwood, vivid blue resin, and the unmistakable shimmer of abalone. Its striking contrast creates a refined yet powerful aesthetic that balances modern design with timeless craftsmanship.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e showcases warm, distinctive grain patterns that contrast beautifully against vibrant \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblue resin inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Carefully handcrafted geometric patterns combine rich resin with delicate \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating visual depth and movement while allowing the natural beauty of the wood to remain an integral part of the design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe design continues into the lower section with a bold \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblue resin butt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating a strong visual connection with the forearm while adding depth and color. Meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e introduce subtle flashes of iridescence throughout the cue, tying the individual design elements together with refined detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e completes the handle, adding distinctive texture, luxurious character, and a comfortable feel in the hand. The precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a solid and dependable connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors who appreciate bold design without sacrificing elegance, the Sapphire Noir is a distinctive expression of handcrafted cue artistry—where natural wood, vivid resin, shimmering abalone, and premium detailing come together in perfect balance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Blue Resin\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Black Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u00